# name: follow_dog
# description: follow the closest dog at a safe distance
# triggers: follow the dog, follow dog, chase the dog, follow the puppy, come with dog, track the dog
# plan: follow the closest dog@FOLLOW
#
# Like follow_human but targeting a dog: trails the closest dog at a safe
# standoff, AVOIDING obstacles (move mode, NOT push) — never drives into it, and
# turns to re-find it if it leaves the camera's view. Runs until you press Stop.

PRINT "Looking for a dog to follow — press Stop to end."
SET r = FOLLOW("dog", 1.0)
PRINT "Stopped following the dog."
